Data.Cycle.即将更新全部员工和部门信息，更新后：1. 上级评估、校准等评估任务的:
Once you click "OK", all individual and department information will be updated. After the updates: 

 1. Leader reviews, calibrations, and other review tasks will be based on the updated information;
 2. Reports, lists of individuals, details of individuals, and other data will be based on the updated information;
 3. This action cannot be undone. You can make multiple updates before project starts.

Data.Invitation.重点工作填写提示:
1. Your key outputs will be visible to invited reviewers, enabling them to give more comprehensive feedback;
 2. Other colleagues can volunteer to be your reviewers, but are unable to view your key outputs;
 3. Your leader and HRBP can view your reviewer list. They can also add key outputs and reviewers on your behalf;
 4. The invited reviewers who have given feedback will be notified of updates to your key outputs.

Data.Review.填写最终反馈.填写提示.Title:
1. Please stay focused and avoid multi-tasking in communication;
2. If you encounter any question that you are unsure or unable to answer, please contact HRBP to confirm first;
3. Please complete performance communication first before you submit the final feedback. After submission, the reviewee will be notified and can view performance review results and final feedback;
4. Comments must not contain any language that could be deemed as discrimination, harassment or retaliation.

