Data.modal.groupTips:
1. On this page, you can divide reviewees into different groups and customize review subjects accordingly;
2. When configuring the project, you can select the scope of reviewees by group.<0></0>
3. You can configure 1 principal review item for each group, the result of which represents the reviewee's performance result in scenarios such as Feishu CoreHR

Data.project.start_tip_content:
Once the project is launched, 
1. Each step will automatically run at specified times;
2. The on/off status and start time of the cycle, the performance template, the review scope, and the step in progress can no longer be modified. However, you can modify the on/off status and start time of any unstarted steps and the deadline of each step.

Data.project.start_tip_with_start:
Once the project is launched, 
1. Each step will automatically run at specified times. The launch time of {{stage}} is earlier than the current time, and they will run immediately once the project is launched;
2. The on/off status and start time of the cycle, the performance template, the review scope, and the step in progress can no longer be modified. However, you can modify the on/off status and start time of any unstarted steps and the deadline of each step.
